Your **Studio Handle** is your public identity on Beat22, visible on your beats, profile, and during buyer interactions. Want to change it? It’s super simple.

## **Steps to change your studio handle:**

1.   Go to your ****Settings****
    
    ![](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-07-01-004741.png)
    
2.  Click on the **Account** tab
3.  Find the **Studio Handle** field
    
    ![](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-07-01-004806.png)
    
4.  Enter your new handle
5.  Click **Submit**

That’s it — your handle will be updated instantly!
